WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
How do you multiply 23 by 14 in your head?

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:05.240
Split it up.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.170
23 × 10 is 230.

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:11.250
23 × 4 is 92.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.410
Add them.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.290
322.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:21.013
Long multiplication is just this, tens first, then ones, written in columns.
